"k":"31:21","t":"And when it is said to them, \"Follow what Allāh has revealed,\" they say, \"Rather, we will follow that upon which we found our fathers.\" Even if Satan was inviting them to the punishment of the Blaze?","j":21,"h":41,"s":31,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"31:22","t":"And whoever submits his face [i.e., self] to Allāh while he is a doer of good - then he has grasped the most trustworthy handhold. And to Allāh will be the outcome of [all] matters.","j":21,"h":42,"s":31,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"31:23","t":"And whoever has disbelieved - let not his disbelief grieve you. To Us is their return, and We will inform them of what they did. Indeed, Allāh is Knowing of that within the breasts.","j":21,"h":42,"s":31,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"31:24","t":"We grant them enjoyment for a little; then We will force them to a massive punishment.","j":21,"h":42,"s":31,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"31:25","t":"And if you asked them, \"Who created the heavens and earth?\" they would surely say, \"Allāh.\" Say, \"[All] praise is [due] to Allāh\"; but most of them do not know.","j":21,"h":42,"s":31,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"31:26","t":"To Allāh belongs whatever is in the heavens and earth. Indeed, Allāh is the Free of need, the Praiseworthy.","j":21,"h":42,"s":31,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"31:27","t":"And if whatever trees upon the earth were pens and the sea [was ink], replenished thereafter by seven [more] seas, the words of Allāh would not be exhausted. Indeed, Allāh is Exalted in Might and Wise.","j":21,"h":42,"s":31,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"31:28","t":"Your creation and your resurrection will not be but as that of a single soul. Indeed, Allāh is Hearing and Seeing.","j":21,"h":42,"s":31,"a":28,"sd":null}],"juz":21,"hizb":41,"surahs":[31],"sajdah":false}